        description: "你看见一尊古老的雕像，一半沉没在池塘的水中。雕像的手放在一把[blue]石剑[/blue]之上。\n\n同时你还看见，池塘的水底似乎有一些东西在[gold][sine]闪烁[/sine][/gold]着光芒。\n或许是人们祈愿投下的金币？\n\n钱可是个好东西……",
        preconditions: None,
        options: [
        StsEventOption(id: "GRAB_SWORD", title: "Grab the Sword", title_cn: "拿起石剑", description: "获得[gold]石之剑[/gold]。"),
        StsEventOption(id: "DIVE_INTO_WATER", title: "Dive into the Water", title_cn: "潜水", description: "获得[blue]101-121[/blue][gold]金币[/gold]。失去[red]7[/red]点生命."),
        ],
    ),
    StsEventDef(
        id: "sunken_treasury",
        name: "淹水金库",
        act: "Underdocks",
        description: "一条小路让你找到了一个部分淹水的金库。\n你看到里面有[blue]2[/blue]个[gold]箱子[/gold]，但却只有[blue]1[/blue]把[jitter][purple]脆弱的钥匙[/purple][/jitter]。\n\n[gold]第一个箱子：[/gold]你摇晃了一下，能听到叮铃哐啷的轻响，应该是少量金币。\n[gold]第二个箱子：[/gold]巨大、精致、而且显然[red]被诅咒了[/red]。里面有很多金币！",
        preconditions: None,
        options: [
        StsEventOption(id: "FIRST_CHEST", title: "First Chest", title_cn: "第一个箱子", description: "获得[blue]52-67[/blue][gold]金币[/gold]。"),
        StsEventOption(id: "SECOND_CHEST", title: "Second Chest", title_cn: "第二个箱子", description: "获得[blue]303-363[/blue][gold]金币[/gold]。得到[red]贪婪[/red]。"),
        ],
